FINAL CREATIVE VISION:

A cinematic four-stage horror survival campaign.

The player begins in an abandoned village, follows a mysterious creature through a cursed forest, discovers the truth beneath an underground facility, and finally faces the King in a massive arena surrounded by thousands of infected spectators.

The player does not navigate through WASD.

The world carries the player forward through the story.

The player survives through combat, weapon strategy, awareness, and timing.

